WEBVTT

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:32.829
and everybody else has to not
only make something good,

00:12:32.829 --> 00:12:36.579
but also do it and overcome all of these
obstacles to just getting their movie

00:12:36.579 --> 00:12:38.662
made or even being in a position
where they can make a movie.

00:12:39.121 --> 00:12:44.121
So I would like to focus on the
the access to resources and

00:12:44.121 --> 00:12:47.746
the access to distribution problem
far more than I would.

00:12:48.579 --> 00:12:51.287
Hey, who's eligible for an Oscar?

00:12:51.746 --> 00:12:54.954
But I do think that because the
Academy Awards are, you know,

00:12:54.996 --> 00:12:59.704
the time every year when most people are
thinking about the the ecosystem of

00:12:59.704 --> 00:13:04.121
the film industry, it's critical that we
have that conversation about the Oscars